  - Arnbjorn swings his greataxe at Monika.
  - Monika finds herself trapped between Arnbjorn and the table at the center of
    the room.
  - Arnbjorn swings his greataxe at Monika. Again.
  - Arnbjorn swings his greataxe at Monika. Again- (I could've rewritten the Dark
    Brotherhood to include more attack variety...)
  - (I mean, come on, it's not like it's easy trying to come up with five different
    ways to tell the player to dodge an axe while being in-universe narration- IS
    THIS THING STILL ON???)
